#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:31
msgid "HVM quorum witness"
msgstr "Testigo de quorum HVM"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:33
msgid "``worker['worker_key']`` and a reachable Worker URL"
msgstr "``worker['worker_key']`` y una Worker URL accesible"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:34
msgid ""
"Select the Worker as the cluster witness. Cluster Hosts contact the "
"Worker URL for quorum arbitration. For two-Host GFS2 with no Site Groups,"
" see :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`. For stretch "
"clusters with Site Groups, see "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el Worker como testigo del clúster. Los Hosts del clúster "
"contactan la Worker URL para el arbitraje de quórum. Para GFS2 de dos "
"Hosts sin Grupos de sitio, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`. Para clústeres "
"stretch con Grupos de sitio, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:36
msgid ""
"The gateway API key and Distributed Worker key are independent. Configure"
" only ``worker['worker_key']`` for Distributed Worker and witness use, "
"only ``worker['apikey']`` for console and VDI gateway use, or both keys "
"to enable combined roles on one runtime. A console gateway is not a "
"separate runtime mode; it is a VDI Gateway registration selected for "
"console routing."
msgstr ""
"La clave de API del gateway y la clave de Worker distribuido son "
"independientes. Configure solo ``worker['worker_key']`` para uso de "
"Worker distribuido y testigo, solo ``worker['apikey']`` para uso de "
"gateway de consola y VDI, o ambas claves para habilitar roles combinados "
"en un runtime. Un gateway de consola no es un modo de runtime separado; "
"es un registro de VDI Gateway seleccionado para enrutamiento de consola."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:38
msgid ""
"Use separate Worker deployments when gateway sessions, Cloud proxy "
"traffic, and quorum witness traffic require different network zones, "
"independent maintenance windows, fault isolation, or capacity scaling. If"
" roles are combined, the Worker URL, certificates, firewall rules, and "
"availability design must satisfy every enabled role."
msgstr ""
"Use implementaciones de Worker separadas cuando las sesiones de gateway, "
"el tráfico proxy de Cloud y el tráfico de testigo de quorum requieran "
"zonas de red diferentes, ventanas de mantenimiento independientes, "
"aislamiento de fallos o escalado de capacidad. Si se combinan roles, la "
"Worker URL, los certificados, las reglas de firewall y el diseño de "
"disponibilidad deben satisfacer cada rol habilitado."

