#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:56
msgid ""
"An HVM appliance image based on Ubuntu 24.04 is available beginning with "
"|morpheus| 8.0.6."
msgstr ""
"Hay disponible una imagen de appliance HVM basada en Ubuntu 24.04 a "
