#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:57
msgid ""
"A Distributed Worker can also serve as an HVM quorum witness beginning "
"with |morpheus| 9.0. Witness traffic is a separate cluster quorum role in"
" addition to Cloud API proxy support."
msgstr ""
"Un Worker distribuido puede servir como testigo de quorum HVM a partir de"
" |morpheus| 9.0. El tráfico de testigo es un rol de quorum de clúster, no"
" compatibilidad de proxy de API de Cloud HVM."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:58
msgid ""
"For SCVMM and Hyper-V, the Worker proxies WinRM-based API calls and Agent"
" relay traffic to the SCVMM controller host."
msgstr ""
"Para SCVMM y Hyper-V, el Worker hace proxy de llamadas de API basadas en"
" WinRM y del tráfico de relay del Agent hacia el host controlador de "
"SCVMM."

