#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:101
msgid ""
"In order to proxy VMware vCenter Cloud traffic through a Distributed "
"Worker, you must have a static public DNS entry for the internal IP "
"address of the vCenter appliance. If this is not done, everything may "
"appear to be working properly when configuring the Cloud but problems "
"will arise at provision time. This is not a |morpheus| limitation but is "
"a limitation of the VMware SDK client which does not natively support "
"proxies."
msgstr ""
"Para poder proxy VMware vCenter Nube traffic a través de a Distributed "
"Worker, usted debe tienen a static público DNS entry para el internal IP "
"address de el vCenter appliance. Si este es no done, everything puede "
"appear a be working properly cuando configuring el Nube pero problems va "
"a arise en provision time. Este es no a |morpheus| limitation pero es a "
"limitation de el VMware SDK client que hace no natively soporte proxies."

