#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:134
msgid ""
"With the package installed, we need to add a new distributed worker in "
"|morpheus| UI. Distributed workers are added in |AdmIntDis|. To create "
"one, populate the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Con el paquete installed, we need a agregar a nuevo distributed worker en"
" |morpheus| UI. Distributed workers son agregado en |AdmIntDis|. Un crear"
" uno, populate lo siguiente campos:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:136
msgid "**NAME:** A name for the distributed worker in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** Un nombre para el distributed worker en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:137
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** An optional description for the distributed worker"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION:** Un optional description para el distributed worker"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:138
msgid ""
"**PROXY HOSTS:** A comma-delimited list of global proxy hosts, any "
"endpoint listed here will be proxied through the |morpheus| worker. For "
"VMware, you must list the host addresses for any vCenter you wish to "
"proxy through the worker. Xen hosts and PowerVC hosts must be listed here"
" as well. Other Cloud types which are supported by the |morpheus| worker "
"need only have the worker configured on the Edit Cloud modal (|InfClo| > "
"Selected Cloud > Edit button)"
msgstr ""
"**PROXY HOSTS:** Un comma-delimited lista de global proxy hosts, "
"cualquier endpoint listed here será proxied a través de el |morpheus| "
"worker. Para VMware, usted debe lista el host addresses para cualquier "
"vCenter usted wish a proxy a través de el worker. Xen hosts y PowerVC "
"hosts debe ser listed here as well. Otro Nube tipos que son soportado por"
" el |morpheus| worker need solo tienen el worker configurado en el Editar"
" Nube modal (|InfClo| > Selected Nube > Editar botón)"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:139
msgid "**ENABLED:** When marked, the selected worker is available for use"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLED:** Cuando marked, el seleccionado worker está disponible para "
"usar"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:141
msgid ""
"The proxy host URL entered in the Worker configuration must match the URL"
" set in the Cloud configuration. That is, if you use the URL in the Cloud"
" configuration you must also use it in the Worker configuration. The "
"reverse is also true, if an IP address is used in the Cloud "
"configuration, that should be used in the Worker configuration as well. "
"There are also configuration considerations that must be made for "
"proxying vCenter Cloud traffic through a Distributed Worker. See the "
"\"IMPORTANT\" box in the \"Requirements\" section for additional details."
msgstr ""
"El proxy host URL entered en el Worker configuración debe match el URL "
"establecido en el Nube configuración. Ese es, si usted usar el URL en el "
"Nube configuración usted debe también usar ello en el Worker "
"configuración. El reverse es también true, si un IP address es usado en "
"el Nube configuración, ese debería ser usado en el Worker configuración "
"as well. There son también configuración considerations ese debe ser made"
" para proxying vCenter Nube traffic a través de a Distributed Worker. "
"Consulte la \"IMPORTANT\" box en el \"Requirements\" sección para "
"adicional detalles."

