#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:181
msgid ""
"``worker_url`` identifies the Worker service. ``worker['appliance_url']``"
" identifies the |morpheus| appliance. Do not interchange them. By "
"default, ``worker_url`` uses the Worker's hostname. For gateway or "
"witness use, set it to a stable URL that every required client can "
"resolve, reach, and trust."
msgstr ""
"``worker_url`` identifica el servicio Worker. ``worker['appliance_url']``"
" identifica el dispositivo |morpheus|. No los intercambie. De forma "
"predeterminada, ``worker_url`` usa el hostname del Worker. Para gateway o"
" testigo, configúrelo con una URL estable que cada cliente requerido "
"pueda resolver, alcanzar y confiar."

