" comprobaciones específicas del rol."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:302
msgid "Witness Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración del testigo"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:304
msgid ""
"A Distributed Worker can provide quorum witness services for HVM 1.3 or "
"later clusters using an HPE Shared File System (GFS2) datastore. This "
"includes two-node GFS2 clusters and stretch clusters with site groups. "
"For the complete two-node topology, deployment order, validation, failure"
" behavior, and limitations, see "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`."
msgstr ""
"Un Distributed Worker puede proporcionar servicios de testigo de quórum "
"para clústeres HVM 1.3 o posteriores que usen un almacén de datos HPE "
"Shared File System (GFS2). Esto incluye clústeres GFS2 de dos nodos y "
"clústeres extendidos con grupos de sitios. Para la topología completa de "
"dos nodos, el orden de implementación, la validación, el comportamiento "
"ante fallos y las limitaciones, consulte "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:306
msgid ""
"The **Worker URL** on the Distributed Worker record is mandatory for "
"witness use. |morpheus| uses this value to construct the ``witnessUrl`` "
"sent to each cluster Host. Every participating Host must be able to "
"resolve the URL, route to the Worker listener, and trust its TLS "
"certificate. The Worker's outbound connection to the |morpheus| appliance"
" does not prove that Hosts can reach the witness."
msgstr ""
"La **Worker URL** en el registro de Distributed Worker es obligatoria "
"para uso como testigo. |morpheus| usa este valor para construir el "
"``witnessUrl`` enviado a cada Host del clúster. Cada Host participante "
"debe poder resolver la URL, enrutar al listener del Worker y confiar en "
"su certificado TLS. La conexión saliente del Worker al dispositivo "
"|morpheus| no demuestra que los Hosts puedan alcanzar al testigo."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:308
msgid "Before assigning a witness:"
msgstr "Antes de asignar un testigo:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:310
msgid ""
"Create the Distributed Worker record in |AdmIntDis| and set **Worker "
"URL** to the stable client-facing URL for the Worker."
msgstr ""
"Cree el registro de Distributed Worker en |AdmIntDis| y configure "
"**Worker URL** con la URL estable orientada al cliente para el Worker."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:311
msgid ""
"Configure the runtime with the record's ``worker_key`` or "
"``MORPHEUS_WORKER_KEY``."
msgstr ""
"Configure el runtime con ``worker_key`` o ``MORPHEUS_WORKER_KEY`` del "
"registro."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:312
msgid "Verify that the Worker shows as active in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Verifique que el Worker aparezca como activo en |morpheus|."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:313
msgid ""
"From every cluster Host, resolve the Worker URL and make an HTTPS "
"connection to it. A successful TLS connection or HTTP response confirms "
"the path; do not disable certificate validation in production."
msgstr ""
"Desde cada Host del clúster, resuelva la Worker URL y establezca una "
"conexión HTTPS. Una conexión TLS o respuesta HTTP exitosa confirma la "
"ruta; no deshabilite la validación de certificados en producción."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:314
msgid ""
"Ensure firewalls and load balancers preserve the witness path and do not "
"require interactive authentication."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que firewalls y balanceadores de carga preserven la ruta del"
" testigo y no requieran autenticación interactiva."

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:316
msgid "For cluster assignment and quorum validation:"
msgstr "Para la asignación de clústeres y la validación de quórum:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:318
msgid ""
"Two-Host GFS2 with no Site Groups: "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`"
msgstr ""
"GFS2 de dos hosts sin grupos de sitios: "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters`"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:319
msgid ""
"Site Groups / multi-site stretch: "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`"
msgstr ""
"Grupos de sitios / extendido multisitio: "
":doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters`"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:322
msgid "Highly-Available (HA) Deployment"
msgstr "Highly-Disponible (HA) Deployment"

#: ../../administration/integrations/workers.rst:324
msgid ""
"If desired, multiple distributed worker nodes may be associated to the "
"same |morpheus| appliance to eliminate a single point of failure should a"
" distributed worker node go down. Configure each distributed worker node "
"using the same worker key (process described in the prior section) and "
"add redundancy using as many additional workers nodes as needed. When "
"multiple worker nodes are using the same worker key, proxy calls will "
"always go through the primary worker node when possible. The primary node"
" is the first worker node configured using a specific worker key. When "
"necessary, automatic failover will take place and another active worker "
"node will be used. While proxy calls will always try to use the primary "
"node when available, |morpheus| Agent communications can be balanced "
"equally across worker nodes by placing a VIP in front of your distributed"
" workers."
msgstr ""
"Si desired, múltiples distributed worker nodes puede be associated a el "
"mismo |morpheus| appliance a eliminate a single point de failure debería "
"a distributed worker node go down. Configure cada distributed worker node"
" usando el mismo worker key (process described en el prior sección) y "
"agregar redundancy usando as muchos adicional workers nodes as needed. "
"Cuando múltiples worker nodes son usando el mismo worker key, proxy calls"
" va a always go a través de el primary worker node cuando possible. El "
"primary node es el first worker node configurado usando a específico "
"worker key. Cuando necessary, automatic failover va a take place y "
"another active worker node será usado. While proxy calls va a always try "
"a usar el primary node cuando disponible, |morpheus| Agent communications"
" puede ser balanced equally a través de worker nodes por placing a VIP en"
" front de su distributed workers."

